306	    /** What is due on the claim now at the rate in force on the claim's date of its person's grade in
307	     *  force on that date, rounded
308	     *  as the claim's {@link Rounding} decides and at least the sheet's floor (a correction has no floor); null when no rate of the
309	     *  grade applies by then. */
310	    private BigDecimal dueNow(String sheetId, Person person, Claim claim) {
